a little then gives a  nice tribute to elsa's iconic let it go  moment in frozen as he sings let it snow  let it go and showers himself with salt  to mimic snow falling this one might be  a little stretch but i got some rapunzel  vibes from isabella whenever she swung  around on vines created from her magical  gift similar to how rapunzel was  swinging around on her magical hair  entangled mirabelle's mother julieta has  a special power to heal physical  ailments with her food you just healed  my hand with an alle pacon queso and  this is very tricky to spot but in her  kitchen there are some books one of  which is titled  which in english means beer for  headaches the deliberately diy  customized look of mirabelle's outfit  reflects her personality and desperate  desire to be noticed among a family of  super gifted individuals as well as her  own name and picture her highly  embroidered skirt blouse and bag include  shout outs to her loved ones for abuela  there's a candle for peppa a rainbow as  well as a sun and rain cloud various  flowers for her sister isabella an arm  holding up a weight for her sister  louisa a variety of animals such as  snakes and caffey barras for cousin  antonio and a chameleon for camilo and  there's even a note that she loves her  family in there as for mirabelle's  glasses according to the film team  they're part of the storytelling as a  key theme of the movie is perception and  perspective and the role it plays in  family dynamics in other words as one of  the production designers says it's about  how two people can view the same  situation completely differently and how  those different points of view can  affect their relationship on top of that  mirabelle's whole look including her  glasses meant a lot to actress stephanie  beatrice who also wore glasses growing  up and sees a lot of herself in the  character so much so that she started  crying the first time she saw mirabelle  brought to life  when lim manuel miranda sat down to  write the family madrigal he was  especially inspired by the much-loved  opening number from beauty and the beast  belle just like belle family madeligal  gives us a ton of information in a  relatively short amount of time and also  just like the first song in beauty and  the beast presents its main characters  and townsfolk giving us insight into  their roles in the movie so too  encanto's opening number introduces us  to three generations of the madrigal  family and also shows us how they  interact with people in their village  each character's magical gift is also  reflected in their clothing and you can  catch a lot more details about the  characters and their development in the  art of encanto book isabella's flower  power is shown through her dress which  is layered to give the feel of petals  while colombia's national flower the  orchid is embroidered around her  neckline luisa's outfit features weights  which represent her super strength also  look out for raindrops on their aunt  peppa's dress as well as lightning bolts  and her little sun earrings all of which  represent her ability to control the  weather with her emotions julieta has  lots of herbs in her clothes which are  nod to her power of healing through her  cooking and although her husband  agustine doesn't have any powers of his  own to illustrate on his outfit he does  have little hat tips to his three  daughters with a flower from isabella  and his lapel and one sock patterned  with barbells for louisa and the other  embroidered with many things including  butterflies for mirabelle as for peppa's  husband felix according to the  filmmakers the triangles and other  geometric shapes on his outfit represent  his stability and support for his family  and his gifted son camilo's clothes  feature chameleons on his poncho and  sandals which fits his shape-shifting  powers  as the head of the madrigal family  awola's room is at the center of the  house and opposite hers is mirabelle's  room which highlights their connection  and foreshadows the end of the movie as  both women are central to the creation  of the casita but the position of the  rooms also points to their opposite  opinions as well with abuela desperately  trying to hold on to the past and how  things have been while mirabelle sees  things must change for a better future  for everyone  actor alan tudyk voices the toucan in  the movie  uh-huh uh-huh i understand you and after  also lending his voice to animations  including the wreck-it ralph movies  hello my loyal subjects big hero 6. i  love that robot frozen the duke of  weaseltown  zootopia it's weaselton duke weaselton  moana  and roya and the last dragon  he's fast becoming disney's equivalent  to pixar's good luck charm john  ratzenberger  and when i was looking out for hidden  mickeys i wondered whether this cactus  that isabella creates could be one let  me know what you think and if you  spotted any others so who are your  favorite characters in encounter and did  you notice any other easter eggs tell me  in the comments below thanks to omaze  for sponsoring this video go to  omaze.comflix for a chance to win this  incredible la dream house don't forget  to like and subscribe if you enjoyed  this video and you can tap left for my  next disney video including all the  deleted scenes from raya and the last  dragon thanks for watching and see you  next time yupikai movie lovers
 

